<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %> | Citas Médicas</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --sky: #f26868;
        --sky-deep: #d94343;
        --panel: #fff5f5;
        --white: #ffffff;
        --text: #3b1d1d;
        --muted: #7a4c4c;
        --border: rgba(92, 33, 33, 0.12);
        --primary: #d94343;
        --primary-dark: #b72d2d;
        --success: #19b77f;
        --danger: #ef6478;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html, body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100%;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f36d6d 0%, #e95d5d 100%);
        color: var(--text);
      }
      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
      .page-shell {
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 32px 24px 50px;
      }
      .brand-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin: 0 0 28px 8px;
      }
      .brand-mark {
        width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
        position: relative;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(15, 58, 90, 0.12);
      }
      .brand-mark::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 7px 8px 7px 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2b3a4b 0%, #1f2d3b 100%);
        clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 0 0, 55% 0, 55% 52%, 100% 52%, 100% 100%);
      }
      .brand-word {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .hero-panel {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 30px 55px rgba(5, 38, 58, 0.16);
        padding: 18px 18px 0;
      }
      .topbar {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0;
        padding: 14px 20px;
        min-height: 72px;
      }
      .topbar .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .topbar .brand span {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }
      .nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      .nav a {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sky-deep), var(--sky));
        color: white;
        font-weight: 700;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, filter 0.2s ease;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(26, 167, 216, 0.22);
      }
      .btn:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark), var(--primary));
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        filter: brightness(1.02);
      }
      .btn.secondary {
        background: rgba(26, 167, 216, 0.12);
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }
      .btn.danger {
        background: var(--danger);
      }
      .hero-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.82) 0%, rgba(240,248,252,0.8) 100%);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-top: 0;
        border-radius: 0 0 18px 18px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
        min-height: 480px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .hero-copy {
        padding: 42px 42px 28px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .eyebrow {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      .hero-copy h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3vw, 4rem);
        line-height: 0.96;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        max-width: 510px;
      }
      .hero-copy p {
        margin: 18px 0 28px;
        font-size: 1.09rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 430px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .hero-cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        width: fit-content;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sky-deep), var(--sky));
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        color: white;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        box-shadow: 0 16px 24px rgba(26, 167, 216, 0.2);
      }
      .hero-figure {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        justify-content: center;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), rgba(125, 180, 205, 0.25) 35%, rgba(121, 177, 203, 0.15) 100%);
      }
      .hero-figure::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.25), rgba(131, 191, 213, 0.06));
      }
      .doctor-figure {
        position: relative;
        width: min(100%, 480px);
        height: 400px;
        margin-top: 28px;
        border-radius: 220px 220px 0 0 / 230px 230px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.65), rgba(201, 224, 236, 0.25));
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(18,49,76,0.08);
      }
      .doctor-figure::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        top: 38px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 205px;
        height: 205px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6d4b9 0%, #e7b996 100%);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 7px rgba(236, 193, 168, 0.7);
      }
      .doctor-figure::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        bottom: 0;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 330px;
        height: 250px;
        border-radius: 180px 180px 0 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #ebf2f5 100%);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(18,49,76,0.08);
      }
      .doctor-figure .tie {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        bottom: 98px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 22px;
        height: 130px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0f5d8e 0%, #0f5d8e 25%, #1a84d1 100%);
        clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 35%, 100% 100%, 0 100%, 0 35%);
      }
      .doctor-figure .stethoscope {
        position: absolute;
        left: 50%;
        bottom: 74px;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        width: 160px;
        height: 104px;
        border: 10px solid #dfeaf5;
        border-color: #dfeaf5 transparent transparent transparent;
        border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
      }
      .brand-footer {
        text-align: right;
        margin: 24px 0 0;
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-size: 1.08rem;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 20px 40px;
      }
      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }
      .form-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
      }
      label {
        display: block;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      input, select, textarea {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 13px 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font: inherit;
        color: var(--text);
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
      }
      input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: rgba(26, 167, 216, 0.7);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(71, 201, 235, 0.15);
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);
      }
      textarea { min-height: 110px; resize: vertical; }
      .panel {
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .card {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(18, 49, 76, 0.08);
      }
      .premium-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.96), rgba(243,248,252,0.94));
        border: 1px solid rgba(18,49,76,0.08);
        border-radius: 22px;
        box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(11, 62, 88, 0.12);
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .auth-shell {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(260px, 0.8fr);
        gap: 22px;
        margin-top: 28px;
      }
      .auth-card, .benefit-panel {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
        border: 1px solid rgba(18,49,76,0.08);
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(12, 44, 68, 0.12);
      }
      .auth-card {
        padding: 28px;
      }
      .auth-header {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .auth-header h2 {
        margin: 10px 0 0;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2vw, 2.5rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      }
      .auth-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 22px;
      }
      .button-link {
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .benefit-panel {
        padding: 24px;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13, 110, 150, 0.96), rgba(27, 168, 211, 0.9));
        color: white;
      }
      .benefit-panel h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
      }
      .benefit-list {
        list-style: none;
        margin: 20px 0 0;
        padding: 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .benefit-list li {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        font-size: 0.96rem;
      }
      .mini-stat {
        display: grid;
        gap: 6px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      .mini-stat strong {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      }
      .metric-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr));
        gap: 18px;
        margin-top: 18px;
      }
      .metric-box {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.96), rgba(238,245,252,0.9));
        border: 1px solid rgba(18,49,76,0.08);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 18px;
      }
      .metric-box strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
      }
      .metric-box span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .status-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 7px 10px;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        background: rgba(25, 183, 127, 0.12);
        color: #0d7f53;
      }
      .alert {
        padding: 14px 16px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .alert.error {
        background: #fff0f2;
        border: 1px solid #ffc1ce;
        color: #b3263a;
      }
      .alert.success {
        background: #edfdf5;
        border: 1px solid #abf0c8;
        color: #0d7f53;
      }
      .list {
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        display: grid;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .list li {
        background: #f8fbff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 16px;
      }
      .slot-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-top: 12px;
      }
      .slot {
        background: #eaf3ff;
        border: 1px solid #cfe1ff;
        color: var(--primary-dark);
        padding: 8px 10px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .muted { color: var(--muted); }
      table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }
      th, td {
        text-align: left;
        padding: 12px 10px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .page-shell {
          padding-left: 14px;
          padding-right: 14px;
        }
        .hero-panel {
          padding: 12px 12px 0;
        }
        .topbar {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          padding: 14px 16px;
        }
        .nav {
          gap: 10px 14px;
        }
        .hero-banner {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .hero-copy {
          padding: 28px 22px 16px;
        }
        .hero-figure {
          min-height: 300px;
        }
        .auth-shell {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <div class="brand-row">
        <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="brand-word">Dental Rojas</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-panel">
        <header class="topbar">
          <div class="brand"><span>Dental</span>Rojas</div>
          <nav class="nav">
            <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
              <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
              <a href="/appointments/new">Nueva cita</a>
              <% if (user.role === 'patient') { %>
                <a href="/doctor/register">Registrar doctor</a>
              <% } %>
              <a href="/logout" class="btn secondary">Cerrar sesión</a>
            <% } else { %>
              <a href="/login">Inicio</a>
              <a href="/login">Especialidades</a>
              <a href="/login">Doctores</a>
              <a href="/login">Horarios</a>
              <a href="/login">Contacto</a>
              <a href="/login" class="btn secondary">Servicio en línea</a>
            <% } %>
          </nav>
        </header>

        <div class="hero-banner">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">Centro médico familiar online</div>
            <h1>Cuidamos tu salud en tiempos difíciles</h1>
            <p>Accede a los mejores servicios de la red médica online. Estaremos contigo en todo el proceso de agendamiento.</p>
            <a href="/appointments/new" class="hero-cta">Agendar cita</a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-figure" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="doctor-figure">
              <div class="tie"></div>
              <div class="stethoscope"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="brand-footer">dentalrojas.com</div>

      <div class="container">
        <%- body %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
